    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> An exciting legendary world.</strong><br>It is a delightful world that contains various legends and mysterious events, exciting with mysterious underground dungeons and different designs.<br><br></li><li><strong> Learn the story of the character and the game.</strong><br>See the world and the story through the eyes of the dwarf. By fortifying weapons along with mysterious enchantments, you can get the story and revenge.<br><br></li><li><strong> A drama through the eyes of dwarves.</strong><br>Losing everything, dwarves embark on adventures and search for meaning. And under the leadership of Thaldoh, they never forget the day of vengeance.<br><br></li><li><strong> Embark on your adventures in scary underground dungeons.</strong><br>In the dreadful underground dungeons, there may be demons and trolls that no one would have thought of. And challenge through the eyes of a little dwarf!<br><br></li><li><strong> Upgrade your weapons.</strong><br>Mining and discovering precious gems. Upgrade your weapon with valuable enchantments and gems. Remember, only with weapons of the highest level can you challenge the darkness.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> An exciting legendary world.</strong><br>It is a delightful world that contains various legends and mysterious events, exciting with mysterious underground dungeons and different designs.<br><br></li><li><strong> Learn the story of the character and the game.</strong><br>See the world and the story through the eyes of the dwarf. By fortifying weapons along with mysterious enchantments, you can get the story and revenge.<br><br></li><li><strong> A drama through the eyes of dwarves.</strong><br>Losing everything, dwarves embark on adventures and search for meaning. And under the leadership of Thaldoh, they never forget the day of vengeance.<br><br></li><li><strong> Embark on your adventures in scary underground dungeons.</strong><br>In the dreadful underground dungeons, there may be demons and trolls that no one would have thought of. And challenge through the eyes of a little dwarf!<br><br></li><li><strong> Upgrade your weapons.</strong><br>Mining and discovering precious gems. Upgrade your weapon with valuable enchantments and gems. Remember, only with weapons of the highest level can you challenge the darkness.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fight against darkness and take Thaldoh's vengeance. And then accompany the hero Thaldoh's struggle and let grace fulfill itself. Discover mystery and revenge in a fantastical world with a new Role-playing game.",
